  <p class="eyebrow">Base platform + optional add-ons</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">One platform. Add only what your operation needs.</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="section-copy" data-reveal="">Start with centralized company-store control. Then add workflow automation, integrations, procurement, AI, or custom logic only when it solves a real business problem.</p>
  </div>
  
  <article class="solution-base-card" data-reveal="">
