  <h3>One place to control every company store.</h3>
  <p>Centralize orders, reporting, store visibility, and operational status across your Shopify company-store portfolio. Use the base platform by itself if that solves the problem.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="solution-base-features">
  <div><strong>All stores</strong><span>One portfolio view</span></div>
  <div><strong>All orders</strong><span>Central order visibility</span></div>
  <div><strong>Reporting</strong><span>Portfolio + store level</span></div>
