  <div class="addon-card-grid">
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--lavender" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h6v6H4zM14 4h6v6h-6zM14 14h6v6h-6zM10 10h4M17 10v4M10 10 7 7"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h6v6H4zM14 4h6v6h-6zM14 14h6v6h-6zM10 10h4M17 10v4M10 10 7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">01</span></div>
  <h3>OMS &amp; order routing</h3>
  <p>Automate the repetitive work after an order arrives. Split orders by supplier, generate POs, submit supplier orders, route work to decorators, and flag exceptions.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>Order split</span><span>POs</span><span>Decorator routing</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>Your team manually decides where every order goes.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--mint" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 7h4v4H7zM13 13h4v4h-4zM11 9h5a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1M13 15H8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-1"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 7h4v4H7zM13 13h4v4h-4zM11 9h5a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1M13 15H8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-1"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">02</span></div>
  <h3>Supplier connections</h3>
  <p>Connect directly with approved suppliers when they provide suitable APIs or technical access. Automate product data, order submission, status updates, or another agreed workflow.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>Supplier APIs</span><span>Order submission</span><span>Status sync</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>Your team is re-entering supplier data or orders by hand.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--lime" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5h14v14H5zM8 9h8M8 13h8M8 17h5"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 5h14v14H5zM8 9h8M8 13h8M8 17h5"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">03</span></div>
  <h3>PromoStandards integration</h3>
  <p>Use PromoStandards endpoints to connect supported supplier product, pricing, inventory, order, or status data into the workflow your stores need.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>Product data</span><span>Pricing</span><span>Inventory</span><span>Orders</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>You want standardized promo-industry data moving automatically.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--peach" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 6h14v12H5zM8 10h8M8 14h5M19 9l3 3-3 3"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 6h14v12H5zM8 10h8M8 14h5M19 9l3 3-3 3"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">04</span></div>
  <h3>PunchOut catalogs</h3>
  <p>Enable procurement-connected company stores when enterprise buyers need PunchOut. Scope the cXML session, cart return, authentication, PO flow, and buyer-system testing.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>Coupa</span><span>SAP Ariba</span><span>Jaggaer</span><span>Oracle</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>A corporate client wants to buy through procurement.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--finance" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h14v16H5zM8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5M12 4v16"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h14v16H5zM8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5M12 4v16"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">05</span></div>
  <h3>Accounting integration</h3>
  <p>Push clean commerce data into the finance or ERP system instead of recreating the transaction downstream. Integrations can be scoped for QuickBooks, Sage Intacct, NetSuite, or another practical API.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>QuickBooks</span><span>Sage Intacct</span><span>NetSuite</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>Your team re-enters orders into accounting or ERP software.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--ai" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle></svg></span><span class="solution-pill solution-pill--dark">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">06</span></div>
  <h3>AI powered</h3>
  <p>Add AI where it creates a measurable operational or customer benefit. That can include OpenAI workflows, chatbots, calling agents, recommendation engines, or internal assistants.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>OpenAI</span><span>Chatbots</span><span>Calling agents</span><span>Recommendations</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Useful when</small><strong>A repetitive decision or conversation can be handled intelligently.</strong></div>
  </article>
  
  <article class="solution-addon-card solution-addon-card--custom" data-reveal="">
  <span class="solution-addon-card__bg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h7v5H4zM13 13h7v5h-7zM11 8h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v2M13 16H9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-2"></path></svg></span>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__top"><div class="solution-addon-card__identity"><span class="solution-addon-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h7v5H4zM13 13h7v5h-7zM11 8h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v2M13 16H9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-2"></path></svg></span><span class="solution-pill">Optional add-on</span></div><span class="solution-addon-card__number">07</span></div>
  <h3>Custom automation</h3>
  <p>Have a workflow nobody else solves well? Show us how your business operates. If there is a practical technical path, we can build the missing integration, dashboard, approval flow, internal tool, or automation layer.</p>
  <div class="solution-addon-tags"><span>Custom APIs</span><span>Approvals</span><span>Dashboards</span><span>Internal tools</span></div>
  <div class="solution-addon-card__best"><small>Your idea</small><strong>You think of the workflow. We build the missing layer.</strong></div>
  </article>
  </div>
  
  <p class="architecture-note" data-reveal="">Integrations are validated before scope is confirmed. API access, documentation, permissions, licensing, data quality, security requirements, and third-party limitations can affect what is practical.</p>
  </div>
