  <section class="section section--tight customer-story-section customer-story-section--v5" data-nav-label="Success Story" id="success-story">
  <div class="page-shell">
  <div class="customer-story-v5__heading" data-reveal="">
  <p class="eyebrow">Customer story · Club Colors</p>
  <h2 class="section-title section-title--small">Built into the operation.<br/>Trusted like part of the team.</h2>
  <p class="section-copy">A long-term commerce and automation partnership supporting a complex promotional products operation at scale.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="customer-story-v5" data-reveal="">
  <article class="customer-story-v5__quote-card">
  <div class="customer-story-v5__quote-mark">“</div>
  <blockquote>
  <p>We’ve worked with Swishtag for several years, and they’ve become a key part of our team. They’ve helped us build enterprise level commerce workflows that support our business, and their work has been consistently reliable and high quality.</p>
