  <h2 class="section-title section-title--small">Show us where the operation hurts.<br/>We automate the highest-value pain first.</h2>
  <p class="section-copy">You do not need a finished technical specification. Bring us the real workflow, the stores involved, and the manual work your team keeps repeating. We map it, prioritize it, and build around the business return.</p>
