  <article class="onboarding-step" data-reveal=""><span class="onboarding-step__index">02</span><div class="onboarding-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h5v5M12 14h5v5"></path></svg></div><small>Prioritize</small><h3>Find the highest-value pain</h3><p>We separate annoying work from expensive work and identify the workflow where automation can save the most time or protect the most margin.</p><div class="onboarding-step__role"><b>Our part</b><span>Recommend what to automate first, and what not to automate yet.</span></div></article>
  <article class="onboarding-step" data-reveal=""><span class="onboarding-step__index">03</span><div class="onboarding-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4zM8 10h8M8 14h5"></path></svg></div><small>Centralize</small><h3>Create the control layer</h3><p>We establish the shared store, order, and reporting visibility your team needs so the operation has one reliable place to work from.</p><div class="onboarding-step__role"><b>Result</b><span>One dashboard instead of disconnected store-by-store visibility.</span></div></article>
  <article class="onboarding-step" data-reveal=""><span class="onboarding-step__index">04</span><div class="onboarding-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 12h12M12 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></div><small>Automate</small><h3>Remove the repetitive steps</h3><p>We build the selected workflow, such as order routing, POs, supplier connections, PunchOut, accounting sync, AI, or custom logic.</p><div class="onboarding-step__role"><b>Result</b><span>Less copying, fewer handoffs, and fewer places for mistakes.</span></div></article>
  <article class="onboarding-step" data-reveal=""><span class="onboarding-step__index">05</span><div class="onboarding-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 18V9M10 18V5M16 18v-7M22 18V7"></path></svg></div><small>Improve</small><h3>Measure, report, expand</h3><p>Once the first automation proves useful, we use the operational data to refine the workflow and decide what should be automated next.</p><div class="onboarding-step__role"><b>Next step</b><span>Expand only where the business case is clear.</span></div></article>
