  <article class="impact-row impact-row--lime"><div class="impact-row__lead"><span>01</span><strong>Protect profit margins</strong></div><p>Reduce repetitive labor, operational leakage, and expensive handoffs as the number of stores and orders grows.</p><div class="impact-row__result">Result: more margin stays in the business</div></article>
